-- Patrols along the road, out and back with a 20-second stop at each end. Every point lies on the road (cobbles,
-- or rock where the cobbles stop) and every leg was ray-checked at body height against fences, posts, walls and rocks.
-- The Shadewell Guard (9961251) walks the west road loop from Shadewell Town down to the house at the bottom (user's
-- map); Farmer Thoren (9960426) walks from the town's north road up to the Windswept Summit pastures, through the
-- stretch where the live capture saw him walking (sightings at 2-second steps from -8004.5, -88.2 downhill).
-- Each stretch between stops is walked as one smoothed spline (smoothTransition): points are at least 3 yards
-- apart, corners over 45 degrees are rounded, and the sampled curve keeps a yard clear of fences, posts and walls.
